  "body": "The wording right now is focused on the LE transport layer, but it might be possible to get the same security and privacy guarantees from GATT over BR/EDR. I'm inclined to focus on getting 1 transport layer right before adding a second, but would be happy to hear any more informed thoughts on the subject.\n\nThis came up in #14.\n",
